WEBVTT

01:22.589 --> 01:23.214
JOJO'S BIZARRE ADVENTURE
DIAMOND IS UNBREAKABLE

01:23.298 --> 01:25.383
<i>A demon's crept into
our everyday life</i>

01:25.467 --> 01:27.760
<i>It's about to take away
something precious</i>

01:27.844 --> 01:31.097
<i>Our peace has already
crumbled long ago</i>

01:31.848 --> 01:33.933
<i>So casually, so nonchalantly</i>

01:34.017 --> 01:36.352
<i>It's taken from us
before we know it</i>

01:36.436 --> 01:39.689
<i>If we want it back,
now's the chance</i>

01:39.898 --> 01:43.401
<i>With the sharpness of
the piercing arrow</i>

01:44.194 --> 01:47.572
<i>The beauty of two souls united</i>

01:47.656 --> 01:50.241
<i>Wherever you go, chase you</i>

01:50.325 --> 01:52.452
<i>Whenever, chase you</i>

01:52.535 --> 01:54.537
<i>I will chase you</i>

01:54.621 --> 01:56.247
<i>Nowhere to escape</i>

01:56.331 --> 01:58.875
<i>Start running, I will chase you</i>

01:58.958 --> 02:00.960
<i>Tomorrow, chase you</i>

02:01.044 --> 02:03.755
<i>My fists will be the one
to show you</i>

02:03.963 --> 02:08.463
<i>Tenacity decides
who will win or lose</i>

02:09.678 --> 02:14.178
<i>So I chase you</i>

02:17.519 --> 02:21.564
EPISODE 16
LET'S GO HUNTING!

09:17.563 --> 09:18.313
CRUSH

12:08.776 --> 12:11.487
STAR PLATINUM

23:38.757 --> 23:41.926
EPISODE 17
